# Astraphe AI: Frontend Rules

SvelteKit + **Svelte 5** + TypeScript + **Tailwind CSS 3** app in `mobile/`, shipped as a
static SPA/PWA and an iOS app via Capacitor 8. Charts: LayerChart and D3; maps:
MapLibre GL. Package manager is **pnpm** (npm is blocked by the `preinstall` check).

The UI is dark-only, the "Graphite + Sky" theme: graphite surfaces stepping up in
lightness, warm off-white text, opaque hairline borders, and one soft sky accent.
Token sources of truth: `mobile/tailwind.config.js` and the `:root` variables in
`mobile/src/app.css` (keep the two in sync when changing a color).

## Tokens

Use Tailwind token classes in markup. Do not invent colors; if a token is missing, add it
to both files.

| Group | Tokens |
|---|---|
| Surfaces | `bg0` page `#0E0E10`, `bg1`, `bg2` cards `#17171A`, `bg3`; `glass` / `glass2` (white 3% / 6%) |
| Borders | `border` `#26262B` (opaque hairline) |
| Text | `text0` primary, `text1` secondary, `text2` muted, `text3` quietest (hints, placeholders) |
| Accent | `blue` = `sky` = `#7FB4FF` (with `-dim`, `blue-glow`); `on-accent` = dark text on sky fills |
| Semantic | `teal` recovery/positive, `amber` load/caution, `red` alerts/high intensity; also `violet`, `steel`, `green` (each with `-dim`) |
| Wide layouts | `rail` (+ `-border`, `-hover`), `popover` (+ `-border`), `accent-surface` (+ `-border`, `-avatar`) for selected rows |
| Charts | `chartCtl` `#7FB4FF`, `chartAtl` `#6A6A72` |
| Brand aliases | `astraphe-{neutral,muted,teal,amber,red,blue}` (used by `$lib/scoreColors.ts`) |

HR zone colors exist only as CSS variables `--zone-0` … `--zone-5` (`--zone-1` is
`#579BFA`, distinct from the sky accent). In JS/canvas use the hex maps in
`$lib/hrZoneDisplay.ts` (`HR_ZONE_HEX`, `HR_ZONE_COLOR_BY_INDEX`).

Score/metric coloring is centralized in `$lib/scoreColors.ts` (tone → class / CSS var,
`CHART_CTL_STROKE`, `CHART_ATL_STROKE`, strain/recovery helpers). Reuse these instead of re-deriving bands per component.

## Tailwind rules

- No standard palette colors for UI (`slate-*`, `gray-*`, `indigo-*`, `white`, `black`,
  `blue-500`...): map to the tokens above. Third-party brand colors (Strava, Garmin,
  WHOOP...) may stay as hex with a comment.
- Opacity modifiers must be on Tailwind's opacity scale (multiples of 5: `/5` … `/95`).
  Values like `/12` or `/6` generate nothing; use `/10`, `/15`, or an arbitrary
  `[rgba(...)]` value.
- `var(--x)` belongs in `style=""` or `<style>`, not inside class strings; prefer the
  Tailwind token.
- CSS variables do not resolve in canvas `fillStyle`/`strokeStyle`, D3 `.attr()`,
  MapLibre `paint`, or SVG presentation attributes: pass hex (constants from
  `scoreColors.ts` / `hrZoneDisplay.ts`).
- Safe areas: there are no `pb-safe`/`pt-safe` utilities; use
  `style="padding-bottom: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px))"` as `BottomNav`,
  `AuthShell` and the sheets do.

## Typography

Fonts load from Google Fonts in `src/routes/+layout.svelte`.

- `font-sans` = **Inter**: UI and prose.
- `font-mono` = **JetBrains Mono**: numbers, metrics, eyebrow labels
  (e.g. `font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-text2`).
- `font-display` = **Instrument Serif**: page titles and hero numbers
  (e.g. `m-0 font-display font-normal text-[26px]`).

## Surfaces and components

- Card: solid surface, not glass: `bg-bg2 border border-border rounded-[24px]` (same as
  `rounded-card`; `$lib/components/Card.svelte` renders this). Selected/active:
  `bg-accent-surface border-accent-surface-border`.
- Primary actions use `$lib/components/ui/Button.svelte` (`variant` primary / secondary /
  ghost; primary = `bg-blue text-on-accent`). White text on sky fails contrast.
- Other shared primitives in `$lib/components/ui/`: `TextField`, `FormAlert`, `Spinner`,
  `EmptyStateCard`, `DashedNote`, `UiIcon`, `BrandMark`, `AuthShell`. Modals:
  `$lib/components/Modal.svelte`.
- `backdrop-blur` only on overlays: the modal backdrop and floating menus/popovers.
  No decorative gradient glows.
- Navigation: 5-tab bottom nav (Today, Training, Body, Plan, Coach); route grouping lives
  in `$lib/navTabs.ts`, wide-layout navigation in `$lib/wideNav.ts`.

## Svelte 5

- Runes only in components: `$props`, `$state`, `$derived`, `$effect`; no `export let`,
  `$:`, or `on:click`. Events are attributes (`onclick`, `oninput`). Children/slots are
  snippets (`{#snippet}`, `{@render children()}`, typed `Snippet`).
- Shared state lives in `src/lib/stores/*.svelte.ts`, typically a class with `$state`
  fields exported as a singleton (`export const athleteStore = new AthleteState()`).
  Avoid new `svelte/store` `writable` stores (`$lib/confirm.ts` is a legacy exception).
- Backend calls go through `$lib/api.ts` (adds auth headers via `apiAuth.ts`); the client
  never computes TSS/CTL/ATL/TSB, it displays server values.

## Checks

From `mobile/`: `pnpm test` (Vitest, jsdom; tests are colocated `*.test.ts`),
`pnpm test:coverage` (CI gate: 80% lines/statements/functions, 75% branches over
`src/lib`), `pnpm check` (svelte-check).
